cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use poslag, please cite it as below."
title: "poslag: time offsets between position and beam rows in the DeepSense 6G dataset"
abstract: >-
  In several recordings of the DeepSense 6G real-world millimeter-wave dataset the GPS rows are offset in time
  from the beam-power and camera rows by up to 0.85 s, constant within a recording. poslag measures the offset
  with three estimates (held-out position-to-beam accuracy with the shift chosen on training sequences, the
  residual of a beam-on-bearing fit, and the dataset's own bounding boxes against the positions, which needs no
  beam label), locates it in the position stream, reproduces the position-aided baseline of Morais et al. and
  reports what correcting the offset changes, with tests that pin every reported number to the released results.
type: software
